hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16723","Abd Allah narrated to us, my father and Abu Bakr ibn Abi Shayba narrated to me, Muawiya ibn Hisham narrated to us, Sufyan narrated to us, from Humran ibn Ayan, from Abu al-Tufayl, from Fulan ibn Jariya al-Ansari, he said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Your brother al-Najashi has died, so pray over him."
